# History entries prior to 11.0

4 August 2021 Ben Morgan (test65-V10-07-05)
- Modernize CMake script allowing test to be built in system testing
  or as a standalone project

18th June 2021 Igor Semeniouk (test65-V10-07-04)
 - fix test65-download status, when downloaded from secondary server

5 May 2021 Ben Morgan (test65-V10-07-03)
- Do not install tests

18 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test65-V10-07-02)
- Tst65PhysicsList : replaced G4HadronCaptureProcess with
  G4NeutronCaptureProcess, and G4HadronFissionProcess with
  G4NeutronFissionProcess.

04 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test65-V10-07-01)
- Tst65PhysicsList : replaced particle-specific inelastic hadronic
  processes (that have been deleted) with G4HadronInelasticProcess.

18 February 2021 Ben Morgan (test65-V10-07-00)
- Support same CMake version range as core Geant4

08 May 2019 Vladimir Ivanchenko (test65-V10-05-00)
- use ShieldingLEND PhysicsList and Mixmax random engine

09 August 2018  Alberto Ribon (test65-V10-04-03)
- Tst65PhysicsList : replaced the explicit high-energy limit of hadronic
  physics with the one from G4HadronicParameters .

16 May 2018  Gunter Folger    (test65-V10-04-02)
- fix server name. Missed to correct the server name after changes for debug.

16 May 2018  Gunter Folger    (test65-V10-04-01)
