15 May 2018  Gunter Folger    (test65-v10-04-00)  rejected, wrong name
- DownloadLENDData.cmake: Change download file to new path/name.
    Fixes to enable alternative download when download from LLNL fails.

26 Octorber 2017 Tatsumi Koi  (test65-V10-03-06)
- Adding G4_Be, G4_Ge, G4_Au and G4_Pb to list of target materials in test of gamma projectiles
- Using G4LENDCombinedCrossSection and G4LENDorBERTModel for gamma

13 September 2017 Tatsumi Koi  (test65-V10-03-05)
- Adding gamma projectile reactions in test

25 August 2017 Tatsumi Koi  (test65-V10-03-04)
- Update address of ftp site for LEND data

22 August 2017 G.Folger  (test65-V10-03-03)
- Increase timeout for download also in CMakeLists.txt

21 August 2017 G.Folger  (test65-V10-03-02)
- Increase timeout and inactivity limit for download in DownloadLENDData.cmake

24 January 2016 B.Morgan (test65-V10-03-01)
- DownloadLENDData.cmake: Previous tag had some non-obvious untar errors
  on Continuous. Split untar/rename into separate steps to help diagnose
  issues. Explicitly use "cmake -E tar xfz" for gzip extraction inline with
  CMake's ExternalProject behaviour.

23 January 2016 B.Morgan (test65-V10-03-00)
- Make download step a direct CTest-time test
- DownloadLENDData.cmake: New CMake script to download and unpack LEND data
  from LLNL or alternate URL. Essentially the same process as was in CMakeLists.txt
  but delegated to CTest time.
- CMakeLists.txt: Call DownloadLENDData.cmake script as a test. Make tests
  of test65 application depend on it so that data will exist before they
  are run. Note that if data download fails, these tests will still run and
  consequently fail, but process can be traced.

13 October 2016 G.Folger  (test65-V10-02-06)
- remove direct use of theParticleIterator, use GetParticleTableIterator().
    fix required by clang39 on Linux and MAC

